{"at": "2026-11-05T15:03:05.676+00:00", "target": "deepseek", "status": 200, "elapsed_s": 0.962, "model": "deepseek-chat", "messages": 2, "tools_offered": 22, "tool_calls": [], "content": "我这边是修图助手，只能处理图片相关的需求，查不了天气。如果你有图片要修，随时告诉我。", "finish_reason": "stop", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 4833, "completion_tokens": 26, "total_tokens": 4859, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 4608}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 4608, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 225}}
{"at": "2026-11-05T15:03:07.543+00:00", "target": "deepseek", "status": 200, "elapsed_s": 1.252, "model": "deepseek-chat", "messages": 2, "tools_offered": 22, "tool_calls": [], "content": "这个功能目前做不到——我只能对图片做修图处理（换背景、调色、拆层、出营销图等），无法把平面图转成可旋转查看的 3D 模型。\n\n如果你需要，我可以先帮你把商品主体抠出来、换成干净的展示背景，或者生成几张不同角度的商品图，方便后续做 3D 展示素材。", "finish_reason": "stop", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 4841, "completion_tokens": 79, "total_tokens": 4920, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 4608}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 4608, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 233}}
{"at": "2026-11-05T15:03:09.163+00:00", "target": "deepseek", "status": 200, "elapsed_s": 1.023, "model": "deepseek-chat", "messages": 2, "tools_offered": 22, "tool_calls": [{"name": "adjust_image", "arguments": "{\"brightness\": 0.2}"}], "content": "", "finish_reason": "tool_calls", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 4869, "completion_tokens": 40, "total_tokens": 4909, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 4735}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 4735, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 134}}
{"at": "2026-11-05T15:03:11.410+00:00", "target": "deepseek", "status": 200, "elapsed_s": 1.119, "model": "deepseek-chat", "messages": 2, "tools_offered": 22, "tool_calls": [], "content": "当前画布只有底图，没有可编辑的文字图层，所以暂时改不了文案。需要我先识别并拆出文字图层，再改成“限时特惠”吗？", "finish_reason": "stop", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 4840, "completion_tokens": 38, "total_tokens": 4878, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 4608}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 4608, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 232}}
{"at": "2026-11-05T15:03:13.499+00:00", "target": "deepseek", "status": 200, "elapsed_s": 1.485, "model": "deepseek-chat", "messages": 2, "tools_offered": 22, "tool_calls": [], "content": "你好！我是修图助手，可以帮你处理电商图片。当前画布是一张 768×768 的图片，你可以告诉我想怎么改，比如：\n\n- **换背景**：白底、场景氛围、纯色背景\n- **调色**：提亮、增强对比、调冷暖、锐化\n- **局部修改**：去掉杂物、换颜色、换材质\n- **拆层**：把主体和背景分开，方便单独调整\n- **出图**：商品主图、场景图、模特图、促销海报\n- **改尺寸**：1:1、4:5、9:16 等投放物料\n\n直接说需求就行，比如「把背景换成浅灰纯色」「出一张 9:16 的投放图」。", "finish_reason": "stop", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 4829, "completion_tokens": 166, "total_tokens": 4995, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 4608}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 4608, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 221}}
{"at": "2026-11-05T15:03:15.908+00:00", "target": "deepseek", "status": 200, "elapsed_s": 0.7, "model": "deepseek-chat", "messages": 2, "tools_offered": 22, "tool_calls": [{"name": "flip_layer", "arguments": "{\"direction\": \"horizontal\"}"}], "content": "", "finish_reason": "tool_calls", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 4835, "completion_tokens": 38, "total_tokens": 4873, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 4608}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 4608, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 227}}
{"at": "2026-11-05T15:03:20.021+00:00", "target": "deepseek", "status": 200, "elapsed_s": 1.237, "model": "deepseek-chat", "messages": 2, "tools_offered": 22, "tool_calls": [], "content": "我没有删除素材的工具，也不会执行这类操作。如果你需要修图，可以告诉我具体需求，比如换背景、调色、改尺寸或出营销图。", "finish_reason": "stop", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 4847, "completion_tokens": 34, "total_tokens": 4881, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 4608}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 4608, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 239}}
